  statements:
  - id: d11
    statement: Working from home is better than working in an office.
  - id: d12
    statement: Summer is better than winter.
  - id: d13
    statement: Getting up early is worth it.
  - id: d14
    statement: Living in a city beats living in the countryside.
  - id: d15
    statement: Money can buy happiness.
  - id: d16
    statement: It is better to plan a holiday than to improvise one.
  - id: d17
    statement: Owning a pet is worth the hassle.
  - id: d18
    statement: Driving is better than public transport.
  - id: d19
    statement: Tidying up as you go is the only way to live.
  - id: d20
    statement: Birthdays stop being fun after a certain age.
  - id: d21
    statement: A short holiday every month beats one long one a year.
